          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi aliondoka huko akakimbilia kwenye pango karibu na mji wa Adulamu. Kaka zake na ndugu zake wengine waliposikia kwamba alikuwa hapo, wote walikwenda kuungana naye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watu wote waliokandamizwa au waliokuwa na madeni, au wale ambao hawakuridhika walijumuika na Daudi. Jumla yao ilikuwa watu kama 400, naye akawa kiongozi wao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutoka huko, Daudi alikwenda mpaka huko Mizpa nchini Moabu. Akamwambia mfalme wa Moabu, “Nakuomba, baba yangu na mama yangu wakae hapa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22:3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "wakae:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Makala ya Kiebrania: Watoke.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kwako mpaka nijue Mungu atanifanyia nini.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, Daudi aliwaacha wazazi wake wakae na mfalme wa Moabu; nao wakakaa kwake muda wote ambao Daudi alikuwa ngomeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha nabii Gadi akamwambia Daudi, “Usikae hapa ngomeni, ondoka mara moja uende katika nchi ya Yuda.” Basi, Daudi akaondoka, akaenda kwenye msitu wa Herethi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku moja, Shauli alikuwa Gibea, amekaa chini ya mkwaju, mlimani, huku akiwa na mkuki wake mkononi na watumishi wake walikuwa wamesimama kandokando yake. Basi akaambiwa kwamba Daudi na watu wake wameonekana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Shauli akawaambia watumishi wake, “Sasa nyinyi watu wa kabila la Benyamini nisikilizeni, je, mnadhani huyu Daudi mwana wa Yese atampa kila mmoja wenu mashamba na mashamba ya mizabibu? Au je, mnadhani atamfamya kila mmoja wenu kamanda wa maelfu au kamanda wa mamia ya majeshi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa nini nyinyi nyote mmekula njama dhidi yangu? Hakuna hata mmoja wenu anayeniambia habari hii, wakati mwanangu afanyapo mapatano na mtoto wa Yese. Tena, kwa nini hakuna hata mmoja kati yenu anayesikitika au kunieleza kuwa mwanangu mwenyewe anamchochea mtumishi wangu dhidi yangu akinivizia kama ilivyo leo hii?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo Doegi, Mwedomu, ambaye alikuwa amesimama karibu na watumishi wa Shauli akasema, “Nilimwona mwana wa Yese akija Nobu kwa kuhani Ahimeleki mwana wa Ahitubu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahimeleki alimwombea Daudi kwa Mwenyezi-Mungu, akampa chakula na upanga wa yule Mfilisti Goliathi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfalme Shauli akaagiza kuhani Ahimeleki mwana wa Ahitubu, pamoja na watu wote wa jamaa ya baba yake ambao walikuwa makuhani huko Nobu waitwe. Wote wakamwendea mfalme Shauli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shauli akasema, “Sasa sikiliza wewe mwana wa Ahitubu.” Ahimeleki akamjibu, “Naam, bwana.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shauli akamwambia, “Kwa nini wewe na Daudi mwana wa Yese, mmekula njama dhidi yangu? Kwa nini ulimpatia mikate na upanga, halafu ukamwombea kwa Mungu? Kwa sababu hiyo, leo ameniasi na ananivizia.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahimeleki akamjibu, “Kati ya watumishi wako, Daudi ndiye ofisa wa kuaminika kuliko wote. Yeye ni mkwe wako wewe mfalme mwenyewe, kapteni wa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22:14",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "kapteni wa:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Makala ya Kiebrania: Amegeuka ili.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kikosi chako cha ulinzi na anaheshimika kuliko wote nyumbani mwako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leo, sio mara ya kwanza kumwomba Mungu shauri kwa ajili yake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22:15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "leo … yake",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "au je, sasa nimefanya uovu leo kwa kumwomba Mungu shauri kwa ajili yake? Sivyo hata kidogo.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mfalme, usinishuku mimi wala mtu yeyote katika jamaa ya baba yangu juu ya njama hizo. Mimi mtumishi wako, sijui lolote, liwe kubwa au dogo juu ya jambo hilo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini mfalme Shauli akamwambia, “Ahimeleki, hakika utauawa, wewe na jamaa yote ya baba yako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shauli akawaambia walinzi waliokuwa wamesimama kandokando yake, “Geukeni na kuwaua makuhani wa Mwenyezi-Mungu, maana wao wanapatana na Daudi; walijua kuwa ametukimbia wala hawakuniarifu.” Lakini walinzi hao hawakuinua mikono yao ili kuwaua makuhani wa Mwenyezi-Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa hiyo, mfalme Shauli akamwambia Doegi, “Wewe geuka ukawaue makuhani.” Doegi, Mwedomu, akaenda na kuwaua makuhani wote. Siku hiyo, Doegi aliua makuhani themanini na watano ambao huvaa vizibao vya kikuhani vya kitani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha aliwaua kwa makali ya upanga wakazi wote wa Nobu, mji wa makuhani, wanaume na wanawake, watoto wadogo na wanyonyao, ng'ombe, punda na kondoo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini Abiathari, mmoja wa watoto wa kiume wa Ahimeleki, mwana wa Ahitubu, aliponyoka akakimbilia kwa Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abiathari alimweleza Daudi kuwa Shauli amewaua makuhani wa Mwenyezi-Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Daudi akamwambia Abiathari, “Nilijua wazi siku ile nilipomwona Doegi Mwedomu, kuwa atamwambia Shauli. Hivyo, mimi nimesababisha",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22:22",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "nimesababisha:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Makala ya Kiebrania: Nimegeuka.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " vifo vya watu wa jamaa ya baba yako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wewe, kaa pamoja nami, wala usiogope. Maana, anayetafuta kuyaangamiza maisha yangu anatafuta hata yako pia. Ukiwa pamoja nami, uko salama kabisa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
